        "area_or_callout": "B Apartments exterior alley and interior TV room/kitchen",
        "opening_view": "First-person view looking down a narrow paved outdoor alleyway toward a doorway marked with a red 'B' and a left-pointing arrow. Three other player models are visible running ahead in the alleyway.",
        "layout_and_sightlines": "An outdoor cobblestone path flanked by beige stone walls on the left and a blue-painted wall on the right, leading up a small ramp to the entrance of the apartments. Inside the doorway, a narrow hallway bends right into a kitchen/store room filled with metal shelving units and a window looking out towards the B site.",
